{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 0,
    "dDurationMs": 5609,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A question I get asked surprisingly often is, is Veritasium a real element?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6910,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nope, I made it up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9090,
    "dDurationMs": 670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*having fun*"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12849,
    "dDurationMs": 2449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I was a kid about 10 or 11 years old"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15299,
    "dDurationMs": 4860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I went to this Genghis Khan exhibit at a museum, and I didn't know much about Genghis Khan except"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 20160,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he was some famous warrior who lived a long time ago"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23010,
    "dDurationMs": 5639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I was thinking maybe we'd see his mummified body or his suit of armor or his sword something like that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28810,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when I got to the museum all they had were like these tiny"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32590,
    "dDurationMs": 5149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "fragments of pottery, and some old shoes, and I was incredibly disappointed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37840,
    "dDurationMs": 5660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in this video, I want to tell you my story but with real pieces of my life"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43640,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*4-year old Derek*: Hi!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45340,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*4-year old Derek*: Hi!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47020,
    "dDurationMs": 7180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Real photons that bounced off my face hit a sensor, created a current that created a magnetic field - flipping some domains on magnetic tape"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54309,
    "dDurationMs": 6470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which was later replayed, recreating the current, passed into a computer, digitized into zeros and ones, beamed to your device, which"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60910,
    "dDurationMs": 2509,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "recreates the light that's hitting your eyes right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63420,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*4-Year old Derek*: I'm waiting for you to take a picture"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67140,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*Derek's Dad* : Of what?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68340,
    "dDurationMs": 1060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*4-Year old Derek*: Of me!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69660,
    "dDurationMs": 5660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now there is a direct path of particles from my four-year-old face to yours right now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75330,
    "dDurationMs": 7739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there is nothing you can do to undo that. I grew up in Vancouver Canada. So I'm mostly Canadian"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 83580,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mostly because my family was South African"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 86760,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*Stereotypical South African Montage*"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93740,
    "dDurationMs": 5060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After my parents got married they moved to Vancouver where my two older sisters were born"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99300,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I was born in Australia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102660,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's because my dad was working there as an engineer at a pulp and paper mill at the time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107870,
    "dDurationMs": 5760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is the first house where I ever lived I lived there for the first 18 months of my life"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114050,
    "dDurationMs": 4619,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Soon after my family returned to Canada and I guess I was a competitive kid"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118980,
    "dDurationMs": 5269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Because I graduated top of my class and had a full scholarship to go and study engineering at Queen's University"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 125010,
    "dDurationMs": 3319,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The problem was I didn't really want to be an engineer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128490,
    "dDurationMs": 6199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I wanted to be a filmmaker but, there isn't a straightforward path to becoming a filmmaker like there is for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135000,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Becoming an engineer or a doctor or a lawyer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137970,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Plus your chance of success at filmmaking is very low"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141470,
    "dDurationMs": 6660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Especially in the year 2000 when your best bet is probably to become a PA and try to catch a break somewhere"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 148200,
    "dDurationMs": 6110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It didn't feel like a meritocracy or like your life was in your own hands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154620,
    "dDurationMs": 6300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, what did I do? Well, I did the smart thing. I took the scholarship and completed a degree in engineering physics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161780,
    "dDurationMs": 720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*Friend*: It's starting to get power"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162700,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*college Derek*: Winderrific"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 164000,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You know some people seem to think it's strange to have interests in both science and film, but to me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170570,
    "dDurationMs": 3299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They are both incredible ways of getting at the truth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 173900,
    "dDurationMs": 6480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean film records everything exactly as it happens and it never changes so it's like this perfect"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180920,
    "dDurationMs": 5880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Observation so you can't fool yourself later like about how I felt stifled by four years of engineering"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 186860,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*Post engineering Derek*: I feel like I've been stifled by four years of engineering."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190680,
    "dDurationMs": 6180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now while I was at college I did take a few film production courses as many as I could squeeze into my engineering timetable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196940,
    "dDurationMs": 6560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My final project was a film about someone who is really good at math, but really wants to be an artist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204240,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*laughs* So that's really painfully autobiographical"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208480,
    "dDurationMs": 4940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I also made videos with my engineering friends, but they always wanted to do something with a gimmick,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214100,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like vampires, ninjas, Bigfoot, pirates"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220240,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The videos weren't very good and we didn't even post them to YouTube. Why not?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 225550,
    "dDurationMs": 2360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well because YouTube didn't exist yet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228459,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so after the engineering degree"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 230580,
    "dDurationMs": 6809,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I decided to move to Australia and go to film school see the Lonely Planet guide and the film school application on my desk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237660,
    "dDurationMs": 3779,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*2004 Derek*: I'm leaving in five days, and I've done barely anything to get ready"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241440,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But once I got to Australia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243010,
    "dDurationMs": 6730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I figured I needed to get a job and get some film experience before I could make a decent application"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 249820,
    "dDurationMs": 7000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean they weren't just gonna accept this Canadian engineer with some ridiculous videos; and on my sixth day in the country,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256820,
    "dDurationMs": 7600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I auditioned for and got a role in this play at the University of Sydney and then I started asking around about physics tutoring work and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264940,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Within a couple weeks, I had enrolled in a PhD in the School of Physics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269260,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*Derek doing PhD*: So it seems like a kind of funny place to be in given that I came here to do film but,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274020,
    "dDurationMs": 10620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after a short time I realized how much I still liked learning and how much I liked physics and I was hoping that I could meld the two, physics and film"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284820,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a PhD about how to make films that actually teach physics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289200,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, I know that sounds incredibly relevant now"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291180,
    "dDurationMs": 5100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But at the time it didn't really satisfy either of my passions in physics or film"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296400,
    "dDurationMs": 7500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I know because this is me the night the data first starts coming in from students watching videos that contain misconception"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303900,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*Derek doing PhD*I just think that you know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306250,
    "dDurationMs": 5089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "including extra material that is wrong and stuff into multimedia segments is just something that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 311680,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "no one's ever gonna really put time and energy into and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315130,
    "dDurationMs": 5929,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's never really gonna be worth much and that sort of pisses me off and I wish I was doing something a bit more practical"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321250,
    "dDurationMs": 3649,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After I got my PhD, I applied to the film school"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324900,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*Derek post Phd*: Now I feel like I'm ready to become an after student"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 326900,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and got rejected. I got rejected again the next year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331020,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I applied twice to the drama school, but never made it past callbacks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 335100,
    "dDurationMs": 4410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was looking for that well-defined path toward a creative career"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339760,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but failing at that I did the smart thing and I took a job as the head of science at a tutoring company"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344830,
    "dDurationMs": 5269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where I'd been teaching during my PhD they were making motors and it was a great job"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350100,
    "dDurationMs": 6029,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I love the students and the other teachers and the flexibility. I had the pay was great"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356130,
    "dDurationMs": 6450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so at the end of 2010 my friends were a bit confused when I told them I was quitting full-time work to start a"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362580,
    "dDurationMs": 3509,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "YouTube channel, but I guess I had reached a kind of breaking point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366090,
    "dDurationMs": 6930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I was 28 years old and I'd spent my whole life up to then building backup plans and doing the things that were most likely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373020,
    "dDurationMs": 1150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to succeed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374170,
    "dDurationMs": 4160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Engineering and a PhD and teaching and I wanted to make this shift"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378330,
    "dDurationMs": 3389,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was like a shift in life philosophy towards pursuing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 382120,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wholeheartedly the things that I felt to be true"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384790,
    "dDurationMs": 5630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the things that I'd always told myself I wanted to do, the things I told myself I wanted to be, I wanted to aim for"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390420,
    "dDurationMs": 5250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That and not just something that was safe a good strategic decision in the moment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396280,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So is veritasium a real element?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399100,
    "dDurationMs": 4180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well for me it was! it was that idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 403380,
    "dDurationMs": 2980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That I wanted to pursue things, I felt to be true"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406380,
    "dDurationMs": 4109,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you think that this would be the triumphant moment from which I'd never look back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 410760,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the truth is it I wasn't very good at making youtube videos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417080,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*Derek teaching*: It attracts any object with mass"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 419110,
    "dDurationMs": 5809,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Towards any other object with mass  *I was stiff*  an online science video blog"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424960,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*My presentation style was unnatural and the pacing was slow*"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 430300,
    "dDurationMs": 6350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Fiji water has been recommended to me by a friend for example the mass of the Sun"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436650,
    "dDurationMs": 6149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*Present Derek*: Sometimes I think it's a blessing not to know how bad you are because if I had known I probably would have quit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442900,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I didn't and so I kept working at it and after a couple of years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447100,
    "dDurationMs": 5149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I started making enough money on YouTube that I could stop doing all other work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452250,
    "dDurationMs": 6210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So YouTube became my main source of livelihood and from that point on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458530,
    "dDurationMs": 5149,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've done  so many amazing things that I never could have imagined"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464230,
    "dDurationMs": 2939,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the greatest adventure by far is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467560,
    "dDurationMs": 7100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one that I haven't told you about but it's when I moved to LA and met a girl and fell in love and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480560,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*Derek*: Will you marry me?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482700,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*laughs, happiness*"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 485900,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*Mrs. Derek*: Yes!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489100,
    "dDurationMs": 500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yes!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 492360,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And here we are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 496360,
    "dDurationMs": 880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*Derek jr*: Fly drone!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497760,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Gonna fly the drone gonna go outside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 501740,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now my ability to do what I love every day is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 506759,
    "dDurationMs": 3199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All thanks to you and I know that may sound cheesy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510500,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it is absolutely, true that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513560,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every video view and like and comment and share"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517529,
    "dDurationMs": 6650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All of that great stuff is what has made veritasium and by extension my life possible. So"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524910,
    "dDurationMs": 7940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Seriously, thank you. And I guess I owe a debt of gratitude to YouTube because they've made possible something that was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533490,
    "dDurationMs": 3199,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unimaginable in the year 2000 when I graduated from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536939,
    "dDurationMs": 6440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From high school and it still didn't exist in 2004 when I graduated from college and I think about the people who are currently in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543379,
    "dDurationMs": 7559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "high school and college and I think well the job that you will have may not have been invented yet or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551279,
    "dDurationMs": 7489,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You may invent it. So what is the point of my story is it to say if you follow your dreams anything is possible?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 560160,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hardly, because I'm all too aware of the survivor bias"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563600,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is if you look at the subset of people who are successful at a particular thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567620,
    "dDurationMs": 3059,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well, you're kind of ignoring all the experience of the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571290,
    "dDurationMs": 2929,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many more people who did not manage to succeed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574470,
    "dDurationMs": 4729,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So when I see actors talking about just you know, pursue your dreams and you can do anything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579509,
    "dDurationMs": 5390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It feels really wrong. Like there's this statistical bias in it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585329,
    "dDurationMs": 7280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but at the same time I feel like there's a paradox to the survivor bias because the one thing you know about the people who"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592889,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Survived are that they..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 595559,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "attempted in the first place that they"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598110,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ignored the logical choice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600990,
    "dDurationMs": 4609,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That, you know, survivor bias would have you believe never try something which is statistically unlikely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 606660,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They ignored that and they went for it anyway"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608819,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I guess my advice is if there is something you feel you really want to do"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 615130,
    "dDurationMs": 5460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then you should at least try it and accept that there is a very high probability of failure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620590,
    "dDurationMs": 5190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but better to try than the alternative where you face certain failure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 626840,
    "dDurationMs": 3169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now having kids definitely makes it harder to make videos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630009,
    "dDurationMs": 871,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "*Pre-tantrum*"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630950,
    "dDurationMs": 4219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Mainly because I want to spend all my time playing with them and not say, editing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635180,
    "dDurationMs": 4820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So thank you for being patient as the pace of video uploads has slowed to a crawl"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641030,
    "dDurationMs": 4849,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But you know having kids has also made me re-evaluate the types of videos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 645880,
    "dDurationMs": 4739,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I want to be making and what I want to be doing with my time, you know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650620,
    "dDurationMs": 4320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This idea of veritasium was an idea where I wanted to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655370,
    "dDurationMs": 6710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Focus on the things I really wanted to accomplish and go straight for those. I think that's a decision"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 662080,
    "dDurationMs": 5039,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You don't just make once but you have to keep making and keep reevaluating and that's what I'm doing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 667430,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trying to decide exactly what I want to do next for veritasium"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 671630,
    "dDurationMs": 4130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you've got any ideas leave them in the comments below and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676640,
    "dDurationMs": 4700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thank you for sticking with me as this channel and I evolve"
